<title>INDONESIA: Astra H1 net edges up to 182.83 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Astra H1 net edges up to 182.83 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>Consolidated Results</p>
<p>    Net profit				    182.83 vs 181.04</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	     315 vs 311</p>
<p>Automotive and Non Financial Services</p>
<p>    Net revenues				6,233.38 vs 5,439.17</p>
<p>    Operating profit			    561.19 vs 534.61</p>
<p>Financial Services</p>
<p>    Revenues			610.66 vs 401.59</p>
<p>    Expenses			483.78 vs 295.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		126.88 vs 106.36</p>
<p>Note: PT Astra International has interests ranging from automotive, financial services to agrobusiness.</p>
</text>
